#: setup/qml/Main.qml:350
msgid ""
"Let's set up Monet. It takes about 15 minutes, and Windows sets itself up afterwards."
msgstr ""
"Installons Monet. Cela prend environ 15 minutes, et Windows s’installe tout seul ensuite."

